## Clues
1-2. A city in Persia. ~ KOM
1-4. A sea—Russian empire. ~ KARA
2-6. An island—Hawaiian. ~ MAUI
3-7. A city in Brazil. ~ BAHIA
8-13. A city in Turkey. ~ ADANA
9-10. A city in Persia. ~ YEZD
9-11. A city in northern Africa. ~ YAT
11-12. A waterfall in Idaho. ~ TWIN
14-19. A city in Portugal. ~ BRAGA
15-16. A city in Spain. ~ REUS
16-18. A mountain in India. ~ SER
17-18. A city in Hungary. ~ GYOR
20-24. A city in Asiatic Russia. ~ TOMSK
21-25. A city in Japan. ~ OTSU
23-26. An Asiatic monarchy. ~ SIAM
25-26. A city on the Danube river. ~ ULM
5-22. A city in Germany. ~ HAARLEM


